  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 4647845888
    m_Localized: Quit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4836589568
    m_Localized: Credits
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4840783872
    m_Localized: Don't miss the pendulum's glow
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4840783873
    m_Localized: "<size=46><color=#4AA0C2>\u25CB</color></size> It glows the moment
      it passes the top"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4840783874
    m_Localized: When it glows, count +1
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4840783875
    m_Localized: "<size=46><color=#4AA0C2>\u25CB</color></size> Stay alert, even
      if it won't go over"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4840783876
    m_Localized: Some feint and turn back just before the top
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4840783877
    m_Localized: "<size=46><color=#4AA0C2>\u25CB</color></size> It might change direction
      mid-swing\u2026?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4840783878
    m_Localized: It reverses after glowing. Don't be fooled
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4840783879
    m_Localized: <sprite name="space"> +1    /    <sprite name="ctrl"> -1    /   
      10 sec per wave
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4840783880
    m_Localized: Retry
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4840783881
    m_Localized: Title
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4840783882
    m_Localized: Close
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4840783883
    m_Localized: You can also close with <sprite name="space"> / <sprite name="esc">
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
